<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank 1-week rev repo ave yield 16.19 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank 1-week rev repo ave yield 16.19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield at the Czech central bank's (CNB) one-week reverse repo tender to drain market liquidity on Monday hit 16.19 percent, the CNB said.</p>
<p>It added that all bids at the maximum rate of 16.2 percent -- unchanged from a similar operation last Thursday -- were satisfied. The CNB does not reveal the amount of funds it drains in its open market operations.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
